["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"David Byrne Explains How Forgotten Ideas Come Back to Life Minsky moment Portland cement lime clasts\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-17-oddlots-古罗马混凝土两千年不裂-现代配方却只敢保50年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>古罗马混凝土两千年不裂，现代配方却只敢保50年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">罗马混凝土里能自愈裂缝的石灰颗粒并非技术失传，而是被工业偏见和商业利益一起搁置，直到MIT团队十几年前重新验证了它的自愈能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">思想复兴</span><span class=\"tag\">罗马混凝土</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1366: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin PEPFAR PrEP Coxsackievirus lipid nanoparticle (LNP) microtesla magnetic therapy (MMT)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-17-twiv-美国切断艾滋病援助后-乌干达和津巴布韦治疗量骤降三成/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>美国切断艾滋病援助后，乌干达和津巴布韦治疗量骤降三成</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">来自乌干达和津巴布韦四家机构的真实数据：治疗覆盖率降31.5%，检测降63.8%，暴露前预防用药降71.6%——断供意味着病毒继续传播、更多人死于本可预防的艾滋病。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共卫生拨款</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"CoreWeave Crash, AI Trade Cracks, Anthropic IPO Red Flags, Bill Gates Doomer CDS neocloud payback period net revenue retention distillation Jevons paradox\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-17-allin-anthropic该拿两千五百亿现金换低估值-而不是冲两万亿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d03474c768c50875-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic该拿两千五百亿现金换低估值，而不是冲两万亿</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chamath认为，比起把估值吹到两万亿美元，Anthropic更该把IPO价格定得足够低，一次性融到两千到两千五百亿美元现金，因为未来几年融资风险远大于技术风险。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力融资</span><span class=\"tag\">CoreWeave</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Financing In The AI Boom: Masters in Business with Bob Michele TIPS hyperscalers private credit dot plot muni bonds stable coin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-16-mastersinbiz-美元成唯一储备货币-日元欧元人民币黄金轮番冲击都败退/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>美元成唯一储备货币：日元欧元人民币黄金轮番冲击都败退</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">摩根资产管理固收负责人说，做了二十多年央行资产配置顾问，第一次想不出能替代美元的货币——日元、欧元、人民币、黄金都被当作候选人，最后全部退场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">固定收益</span><span class=\"tag\">美联储</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"There&#x27;s never been a better time to go into math Erdős problems rising sea anything you can do I can do better future spiky frontier\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-16-karpathy-即使ai证明定理完全超过人类-数学的价值几乎不会改变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b1eb151801bab97c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">40:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>即使AI证明定理完全超过人类，数学的价值几乎不会改变</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">数学的钱主要来自教学，而非证明本身；AI把定理证明变成原始数据后，稀缺的是搭建理论、练口头表达，以及谁该获得学术功劳。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数学</span><span class=\"tag\">学术体系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Release Me From This Demon swap prime brokerage intermediation mention markets\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-16-moneystuff-赌球换个说法叫-掉期合约-就绕开了各州博彩监管/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">37:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>赌球换个说法叫「掉期合约」，就绕开了各州博彩监管</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kalshi 的体育投注赌的是同一场比赛、同样的点数盘口，仅因挂在联邦监管的掉期合约名下，就不受各州博彩法管辖，最高法院正要裁决这是否站得住脚。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">博彩监管</span><span class=\"tag\">预测市场</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Can Write the Code. Can It Run the System? | Grepr CEO Jad Naous semantics vs syntax AI SRE auto-promotion / shredding chaos engineering WSL\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-16-a16z-ai能写出可投产的代码-但还没人敢让它独自运维一个分布式集群/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>AI能写出可投产的代码，但还没人敢让它独自运维一个分布式集群</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">代码的解空间和训练数据同分布，AI才能一路狂飙；运维要应对训练数据之外的真实世界，这道分野决定了AI接下来卡在哪一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI编程</span><span class=\"tag\">运维自动化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Vol.287｜且加餐：一日三餐，如何塑造人类社会的秩序？｜施展×李筠\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-16-cn27f438-维系民族两千年的不是军队-是一日三餐的饮食禁忌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"东\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">东腔西调</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>维系民族两千年的不是军队，是一日三餐的饮食禁忌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">吃饭是一种高频到没法偷懒的仪式：一天几顿饭的重复比军事、政治更能把身份焊进人的身体里，犹太人靠饮食禁忌撑过亡国两千年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">饮食人类学</span><span class=\"tag\">礼制与等级</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The French Political Crisis That&#x27;s Turning Into a Debt Crisis OMT TPI ESM doom loop debt-stabilizing deficit Zucman tax\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-16-oddlots-法国债务求救陷入死循环-开出的条件恰是政治上办不到的事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">47:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>法国债务求救陷入死循环：开出的条件恰是政治上办不到的事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">欧洲央行愿意兜底法国国债，前提是法国政府拿出可信的中期财政整顿承诺；但2027大选后勒庞和梅朗雄都可能拿不到国会多数，这个前提反而比今天更难兑现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法国财政</span><span class=\"tag\">欧债危机</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Why &quot;How Was Your Day?&quot; Doesn&#x27;t Work, And What Actually Gets Kids Talking interviewing for pain Goldilocks\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-16-raisinggh-孩子不爱说话-不是因为父母不在场-而是不够-可接近/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0716da28e67c869b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">29:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>孩子不爱说话，不是因为父母不在场，而是不够「可接近」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究显示孩子是否袒露不取决于父母是否随时在身边，而取决于车上、散步这类低风险时刻父母会不会反应过度——越淡定越安全，追问越多孩子关得越紧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亲子沟通</span><span class=\"tag\">青春期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why a Chinese AI Lab’s Product Lead Thinks AGI is “Inevitable” | Richard Bian harness semantic routing MoE (Mixture of Experts) domain-enhanced model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-16-chinatalk-蚂蚁大模型产品负责人-agi已经没法叫停-也慢不下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f842f278f81ead1d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>蚂蚁大模型产品负责人：AGI已经没法叫停，也慢不下来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的逻辑是：资本已经把这块石头推下坡，所有玩家都朝同一个方向加速冲；哪怕出现过几次强力叫停的尝试，答案依然是——不能停，也慢不下来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"IGBTs Took Silicon Power to the Next Level IGBT latch-up conductivity modulation Deep P+ parasitic NPN BJT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-asianometry-让igbt真正好用的秘诀-是故意调低它的电流上限/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8d76566e7179c7c2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">23:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>让IGBT真正好用的秘诀，是故意调低它的电流上限</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">东芝工程师中川昭夫发现，解决IGBT闩锁烧毁问题的办法不是把安全电流上限往上提，而是把器件饱和电流主动压到闩锁门槛之下，让它先饱和而不是先烧穿。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">功率半导体</span><span class=\"tag\">IGBT</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"From Posting to Policy: Saif Khan on DUV and the AI Balance DUV immersion lithography EUV lithography RSI (recursive self-improvement) MATCH Act IFP (Institute for Progress)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-chinatalk-继续出口duv光刻机-恐让美国十亿芯片产能优势拱手让人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba99cbd30a45f8e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">59:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>继续出口DUV光刻机，恐让美国十亿芯片产能优势拱手让人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国智库测算：若放行次代DUV光刻机，中国2030年代芯片产能可能追平美国；现在收紧出口，差距会被锁定在近百倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">DUV光刻机</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How to get into AI safety in 3 months (article reading by career advisor Matt Beard) BlueDot course EA Forum LessWrong deliberate practice fellowship\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-eightythousand-ai安全招聘效率低到离谱-先把活干出来比投简历更快被看见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08f7aec7acf61633-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">18:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>AI安全招聘效率低到离谱：先把活干出来比投简历更快被看见</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因为人才市场效率低到难以筛选，公开写作、公开做项目、主动建立人脉，比海投简历更快能让你被AI安全领域的招聘方看见。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">职业转型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"When AI Agents Start Spending Your Money | Alex Rampell &amp; Terry Angelos VGS (Very Good Security) PAN network token PCI DSS agentic token chargeback\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-a16z-ai代理能替你刷卡的三个月-从零冲到每周几百万笔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>AI代理能替你刷卡的三个月：从零冲到每周几百万笔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">支付凭证让agent从「推荐你买」变成「替你买」,VGS这类凭证金库由此从单人用升级为多人共享，新的agentic token标准三个月内就从零冲到每周几百万笔。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">支付基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang | Does AI Revenue Justify Capex, &#x27;27 AI Bottlenecks, Singularity, Open vs Closed &amp; more Physical AI Digital twin Zero trust Fungible compute RevShare Navier-Stokes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-bg2-黄仁勋-算力泡沫的风险被算错了账-不该全押在两家ai实验室身上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fadb1586fa86c61b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">1:39:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">BG2</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋：算力泡沫的风险被算错了账，不该全押在两家AI实验室身上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把NVIDIA的收入拆成三等份——经典计算、前沿实验室、海量新创公司各占三分之一，真正卡住明年43吉瓦新增算力的是土地电力和厂房，不是两家实验室的收入曲线。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">资本开支</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Revolutionizing Cybersecurity and AI-Driven Science with OpenAI President Greg Brockman Dots Daybreak defender&#x27;s window debate / iterative amplification generative UI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-nopriors-openai总裁断言-网络安全支出该超过软件开发本身支出/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/857d9061e21bb4fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">39:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI总裁断言：网络安全支出该超过软件开发本身支出</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">软件因AI变得极度廉价，可靠与安全才是真正稀缺的东西——OpenAI内部曾让四分之一工程师停工专职补漏洞。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI数学突破</span><span class=\"tag\">药物研发</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Madness of Markets (Alex Edmans) | #431 limits to arbitrage law of one price big market delusion illusory truth effect equity premium puzzle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-rationalreminder-一个国家输掉世界杯-次日股市真的会跌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>一个国家输掉世界杯，次日股市真的会跌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究追踪一千多场世界杯淘汰赛发现，球迷情绪会让次日本国股市下跌约0.5%,说明价格不仅由基本面决定，也会被情绪左右。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行为金融学</span><span class=\"tag\">过度反应</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jeff Yan&#x27;s Plan to Bring the Entire Financial Industry Onto Hyperliquid Oracle Deployer Dutch auction Perpetual futures (perps) HIP3\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-oddlots-想装下全部金融的hyperliquid-靠27个验证节点运行/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">58:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>想装下全部金融的Hyperliquid，靠27个验证节点运行</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">创始人说目标是用一条链装下全部金融，但目前验证节点总共只有30多个、排名前27的在实际运行网络，跑一个节点只需128G内存的消费级机器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">永续合约</span><span class=\"tag\">Oracle机制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Is the death penalty cruel and unusual? blood atonement evolving standards of decency mitigating evidence majestic generalities\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-throughline-最高法院说死刑-像被闪电击中般随机-全国叫停-四年后又恢复/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/52f805d49b676f98-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>最高法院说死刑「像被闪电击中般随机」，全国叫停，四年后又恢复</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「残忍与非常」四个字从未被制宪者定义清楚，最高法院靠「社会成熟过程中不断演进的道德标准」反复重写它的边界，死刑因此被全国废除，又在四年内卷土重来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">死刑</span><span class=\"tag\">第八修正案</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Viking Origins: The Nordic Iron Age Pre-Roman Iron Age Migration Period Vendel Period bog bodies wandering settlements\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-ancients-维京时代只是尾声-北欧铁器时代的一千五百年被严重低估/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/90576ce4c40955d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>维京时代只是尾声：北欧铁器时代的一千五百年被严重低估</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">维京时代常被当作北欧历史的起点，但研究者认为它其实是一千五百年铁器时代演化到压力顶点的产物，而不是凭空出现的辉煌开端。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">维京时代</span><span class=\"tag\">铁器时代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The History of the Illuminati Streisand effect Protocols of the Elders of Zion Jacobins Federalists\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-historyhit-光明会真实存在但一事无成-查禁它的政府成就了阴谋论神话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/604115789971ea93-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">45:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>光明会真实存在但一事无成：查禁它的政府成就了阴谋论神话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">巴伐利亚政府查禁光明会并公开全部缴获文件后，这个内讧不断、一事无成的读书会反而成了两百年来阴谋论的万能模板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阴谋论</span><span class=\"tag\">启蒙运动</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Elizabeth Holmes&#x27; Husband Billy Evans: The Trial, Prison &amp; Nathan Fielder&#x27;s Documentary First Step Act Raman spectroscopy BOP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-allin-霍姆斯丈夫-她最大的错不是欺诈-是守口如瓶三年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c91d628233831dd0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">41:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>霍姆斯丈夫：她最大的错不是欺诈，是守口如瓶三年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">比利·埃文斯说，法官只要求「在法庭上打这场官司，不在媒体上打」,霍姆斯就守规矩守到全程对媒体一字不提；他认为这才是她犯下的最大错误，因为她的力量本来就在于讲述自己的故事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Theranos</span><span class=\"tag\">联邦诉讼</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"184: 与陈哲的「具身季报26Q3」：Astra冲击后，通用模型会吃掉Robotics吗？ In-Context Learning (ICL) Physical RSI VLA World Action Model (WAM) Robot Dojo FCC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-latetalk-gpt-6-astra能自己设计机器人实验-让ai训练ai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cca2d003691224c6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>GPT-6 Astra能自己设计机器人实验，让AI训练AI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当通用语言模型可以直接在仿真环境里调试、训练自己的机器人策略时，独立具身模型公司「物理AI大于数字AI」的估值叙事就开始松动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">通用大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>"]